      "$4^2 + y^2 = 25 \\Rightarrow y = 3$ m.",
      "$4(0.01) + 3(dy/dt) = 0 \\Rightarrow 3(dy/dt) = -0.04 \\Rightarrow dy/dt = -4/300$ m/s.",
